          "end_column": 46,
          "symbol": "WovenInputs.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, extra, left, middle, right):\n    d = torch.relu(extra)\n    a = torch.tanh(torch.relu(left))\n    b = torch.sigmoid(torch.sin(middle))\n    c = torch.cos(torch.abs(right))\n    return torch.cat((a, b, c, d), dim=-1)"
        }
      ],
